# Normalize line endings to LF in the repository and on checkout,
# regardless of a contributor's core.autocrlf setting. Prettier's
# default endOfLine: "lf" (.prettierrc.json) only holds if checkouts
# are actually LF — on Windows with core.autocrlf=true they were not,
# which is why `format:check` failed repo-wide (see TASKS.md M0-8).
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
